# Browser-capture staging inbox (BROWSER_CAPTURE_RUNBOOK.md).
# Raw drops land here from Tony's browser and are consumed by
# capture_audit_sources.py --from-file, which writes the DURABLE copy to
# <STATE>/ with a manifest entry. Nothing here is the archive.
#
# Contents are ignored on purpose: a half-saved, wrong-URL or
# WAF-challenge page must never reach a commit just by sitting in the
# staging dir. The directory itself is tracked (via .gitkeep) so the path
# is discoverable rather than folklore.
.capture-drop/*
!.capture-drop/.gitkeep
